{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Prophecy — the text that foretells it all\n\nDark Sanctuary tapestries (Ch.4): Fragments, duel with the Knight, final sacrifice.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Gaster's phrase**\n'Shadows cutting deep' — almost a literal quote of his.","x":-130,"y":-538,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nThe antagonist announced by the text itself.","x":320,"y":164,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Routes**\nEach hidden route reinterprets the sacrifice.","x":-580,"y":164,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Profecy.gif","x":-960,"y":-207,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster.png","x":-129,"y":-938,"width":74,"height":190},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":669,"y":306,"width":166,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/routes.png","x":-920,"y":303,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s_gerson","type":"text","text":"**Gerson Boom — \"The Turtle\"** A discarded stained-glass pane names him as the forger of the magic axe; his saga \"Lord of the Hammer\" mirrors, chapter by chapter, Deltarune's own structure.","x":-580,"y":-300,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_gerson-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gerson-grave.png","x":-580,"y":-510,"width":166,"height":180},{"id":"s_angel","type":"text","text":"**Angel (Player)**\nThe \"Angel's Heaven\" that must be banished according to the Prophecy is one of the text's most direct connections to the Player as a figure. Panes 14-15.","x":-1400,"y":700,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_angel-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/The_Legend_screenshot_Angel%27s_Heaven.webp","x":-1400,"y":510,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_titan","type":"text","text":"**Titan**\nPane 04: first direct textual mention of the Roaring and the Titans, even before Ralsei explains it in Ch.2.","x":-1060,"y":700,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s_titan-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Titan_battle_idle.gif","x":-1060,"y":510,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_susie","type":"text","text":"**Susie**\nPane 12: the Second Hero is \"the Girl, with hope crossed in her heart\" — the basis for the theory of whether it's her. She also breaks a tapestry with her bare hand.","x":-720,"y":700,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_susie-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":-720,"y":510,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_kris","type":"text","text":"**Kris**\nPane 09: the First Hero is \"the Cage, with SOUL and human parts\" — key to the theories about his nature.","x":-380,"y":700,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_kris-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":-380,"y":510,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_jockington","type":"text","text":"**Jockington**\nPane 21: \"Jockington grows out his beard\" [TODO: verify exact EN quote] — the only character mentioned by his own proper name in the entire Prophecy.","x":-40,"y":700,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s_jockington-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jockington_overworld.webp","x":-40,"y":510,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_dess","type":"text","text":"**Dess**\nPane 16: the Knight's black knife, the same object from the \"Is Dess the Roaring Knight?\" theory.","x":-1400,"y":1050,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_dess-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dess.png","x":-1400,"y":860,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_queen","type":"text","text":"**Queen**\nPane 18: \"The Queen's carriage\" — confirmed, the image literally shows her inside her Cyber World car.","x":-1060,"y":1050,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s_queen-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Queen_deltarune.webp","x":-1060,"y":860,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_lancer","type":"text","text":"**Lancer**\nPane 22: \"the one with the pointed head\" — a reading based on his design. Unconfirmed.","x":-380,"y":1050,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_lancer-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Lancer_Overworld.webp","x":-380,"y":860,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_tenna","type":"text","text":"**Tenna**\nPane 19: it's him, \"the Lord of Screens\" — cut (his arms) by the Knight after being defeated in Ch.3.","x":-40,"y":1050,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s_tenna-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Tenna_Overworld_gif.gif","x":-40,"y":860,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_friend","type":"text","text":"**FRIEND**\nPane 15: nicknamed by the fandom \"the tail of Hell\". Unconfirmed.","x":-1400,"y":1400,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_friend-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND.png","x":-1400,"y":1210,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_asgore2","type":"text","text":"**Asgore**\nPane 20: \"The Flower Man, trapped in the asylum\" — confirmed as the Ch.5 antagonist.","x":-1060,"y":1400,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s_asgore2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_Dreemurr_overworld.webp","x":-1060,"y":1210,"width":180,"height":170},{"id":"s_shelter","type":"text","text":"**Shelter**\n\"Asylum\" = shelter — a possible early hint at this location.","x":-720,"y":1400,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_shelter-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shelter.png","x":-720,"y":1210,"width":180,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_gerson","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_gerson","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_gerson-img","fromNode":"s_gerson-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_gerson","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_angel","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_angel","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_angel-img","fromNode":"s_angel-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_angel","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_titan","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_titan","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_titan-img","fromNode":"s_titan-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_titan","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_susie","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_susie","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_susie-img","fromNode":"s_susie-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_susie","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_kris","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_kris","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_kris-img","fromNode":"s_kris-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_kris","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_jockington","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_jockington","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_jockington-img","fromNode":"s_jockington-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_jockington","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_dess","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_dess","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_dess-img","fromNode":"s_dess-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_dess","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_queen","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_queen","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_queen-img","fromNode":"s_queen-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_queen","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_lancer","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_lancer","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_lancer-img","fromNode":"s_lancer-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_lancer","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_tenna","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_tenna","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_tenna-img","fromNode":"s_tenna-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_tenna","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_friend","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_friend","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_friend-img","fromNode":"s_friend-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_friend","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_asgore2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_asgore2","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_asgore2-img","fromNode":"s_asgore2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_asgore2","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s_shelter","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_shelter","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_shelter-img","fromNode":"s_shelter-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_shelter","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_dess_knight","fromNode":"s_dess","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s1","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_titan_knight","fromNode":"s_titan","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_tenna_knight","fromNode":"s_tenna","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_susie_kris","fromNode":"s_susie","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s_kris","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_shelter_asgore","fromNode":"s_shelter","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s_asgore2","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_angel_gaster","fromNode":"s_angel","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_lancer_jockington","fromNode":"s_lancer","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s_jockington","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"}]}